# Architecture

Canonical: [`SYSTEM_DESIGN.md`](../../SYSTEM_DESIGN.md), [`docs/contracts.md`](../../docs/contracts.md), [`docs/architecture.md`](../../docs/architecture.md).

```
User → session → proposal → PolicyService → Action.PROPOSED
     → merchant ApprovalService → execution worker → ShopifyMutator → audit
```

No execute MCP tool. No pgvector until knowledge search is real.

## Agents (LLM) vs policy (code)

Orchestrator, Analytics, Inventory, Customer, Strategy, Action Planner.

`PolicyService` is not an agent and has no `LLMPort`.

Read/propose tools only, via `ToolPort.for_agent`. Tenant from `from_session` / `from_job_row` only.

## Stack

Next.js/TS/Tailwind 3.4 · shadcn/ui + Lucide + Sonner + next-themes · Motion · TanStack Query/Table · Recharts · RHF+Zod · FastAPI/Pydantic · LangGraph · MCP-compatible tools · PostgreSQL · Redis · SQS · ECS Fargate · RDS · Secrets Manager · Terraform · GitHub Actions.

UI stack and design direction: [`docs/adr/0019-frontend-ui-stack.md`](../../docs/adr/0019-frontend-ui-stack.md). No alternative UI/animation/chart/state/CSS libraries.

## State

- Action: `PROPOSED → APPROVED → QUEUED → EXECUTING → COMPLETED|FAILED` or `BLOCKED`
- Approval: created by merchant session only
- Queue message: `{job_kind, job_id}` only
